WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.155 --> 00:00:00.988
(upbeat music)
(steam hisses)

2
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:02.264
♪ Oh oh oh oh ♪

3
00:00:02.264 --> 00:00:04.380
You know, I live for a beauty tip.

4
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.740
So here's one for you,

5
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.230
hopefully you'll love.

6
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.540
Hey Drew, it's Chris Appleton.

7
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:09.430
And today I'm gonna show you

8
00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:10.810 line:15%
how to create a messy bun

9
00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.230 line:15%
in a few simple steps.

10
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.690 line:15%
All you're gonna need is a hairbrush,

11
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.010 line:15%
a couple of pins,

12
00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:16.843 line:15%
and I love to use

13
00:00:16.843 --> 00:00:19.680 line:15%
the COLORWOW Style on Steroids texturizing spray.

14
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.800 line:15%
When you're creating a messy bun

15
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.700 line:15%
the key is to keep a lot of texture in the hair.

16
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.940 line:15%
It increases the diameter of the hair

17
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.740 line:15%
and gives you a lot of volume.

18
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.360 line:15%
Then what you wanna do is work the hair up.

19
00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.193 line:15%
Now, what I like to do

20
00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:31.530
is just keep a couple of pieces down at the front

21
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:32.890
and then using my fingers,

22
00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.710 line:15%
just pull the hair up into a high ponytail.

23
00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.650 line:15%
Now, the key for you guys, creating this at home

24
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.240 line:15%
is to follow your cheek bone.

25
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.790 line:15%
That's the perfect place for you to land your ponytail.

26
00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:44.770 line:15%
Then we're gonna take our elastic

27
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.350 line:15%
and tie the hair up high.

28
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.020 line:15%
Now, remember when you're doing this

29
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.880 line:15%
you wanna make sure you almost go a little bit higher

30
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.713 line:15%
than what you want,

31
00:00:51.713 --> 00:00:53.750
just 'cause naturally when you're tying your hair high

32
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.830
it always tends to fall a little bit lower.

33
00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.770 line:15%
I like to then just take my brush

34
00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.270 line:15%
and all we're gonna do

35
00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:00.103 line:15%
is take the bun

36
00:01:00.103 --> 00:01:01.510 line:15%
and just tease it a little bit.

37
00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.260 line:15%
So we have a little bit more volume.

38
00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:04.660
I have a couple of pins.

39
00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:06.300
All you wanna do is twist the hair

40
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.630
and wrap it around in a circular motion,

41
00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.520
taking the very ends

42
00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.680
and just tucking them underneath.

43
00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:13.710
Then what I like to do,

44
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.350
once you get the position right,

45
00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:16.650
is just pin it in place.

46
00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.650 line:15%
Or like I say, you need just a couple of pins.

47
00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:21.770 line:15%
So we'll put one on this side,

48
00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:23.050 line:15%
one this side,

49
00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:25.280 line:15%
and that should be held in place.

50
00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.113 line:15%
A little bit closer

51
00:01:26.113 --> 00:01:27.980
you can see there's nice texture in there.

52
00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:28.950
It's not too neat.

53
00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:31.550
So don't start getting anything that's too perfect.

54
00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:32.880 line:15%
This is your pin you wanna use.

55
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.180 line:15%
I'm just taking a large pin

56
00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.370 line:15%
and just anchoring it right at the base of the bun,

57
00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:38.850 line:15%
just on both sides here.

58
00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:40.140
But at this point, all you wanna do

59
00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.300 line:15%
is just go in and refine the edges.

60
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.390 line:15%
I like to use my fingers.

61
00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:44.970 line:15%
If there's any like real lumps and bumps

62
00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:48.030 line:15%
I'll just take my pin and just pin it into place,

63
00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:50.310 line:15%
just so you can kind of really tidy up the edges.

64
00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.710
And then see any little flyaway hairs like this,

65
00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.610
I like to then use the Style on Steroids, texturizing spray

66
00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.960
just to help give me a bit more volume and hold.

67
00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:59.370
I don't think you need hair spray on this

68
00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.980
because it should be light and airy

69
00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:03.230
and have that really voluminous finish.

70
00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.085
I can't wait to try that.

71
00:02:05.085 --> 00:02:07.668 line:15%
(upbeat music)

